a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","heading":"\u003cp\u003eSet Your Team Up for Success - One Pager\u003c/p\u003e"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eLearn about various tools, including how to post Volunteer Opportunities, build a Peer to Peer Fundraising Campaign, and set up a Matching Grant. \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h1ZAQkiNGHo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eACCESS HERE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","heading":"\u003cp\u003eGive Miami Day Fundraising Tools by Mightycause - Video\u003c/p\u003e"},{"body":"\u003cp data-pasted=\"true\"\u003eHow to Set Up a Match Grant, Access Your Donations Report, Set Up Your Donation Form, and Thank You Page. \u003ca href=\"https://youtu.be/7nilxGeOCFE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eACCESS HERE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","heading":"\u003cp\u003eCampaign Setup \u0026amp; Donation Management by Mightycause - Video\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eLearn how to create and manage a matching gift to inspire donors and maximize contributions. \u003ca href=\"https://youtu.be/W73kt2KosPc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eACCESS HERE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","heading":"\u003cp\u003eHow to Set Up Matching Gifts Tutorial by Mightycause - Video\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eUse the automated emails tool to contact donors and fundraisers based on their interactions with a Give Miami Day page. \u003ca href=\"https://youtu.be/oyev8pAuD-I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eACCESS HERE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","heading":"\u003cp\u003eHow to Use the Automated Emails Feature to Contact Donors by Mightycause - Video\u003c/p\u003e"},{"body":"\u003cp\u003eAn overview of the contacts feature available on your Give Miami Day page to access donor, fundraiser, and volunteer informat